  <metadata>
    <name>Marathon Beneva de Québec 2026 – 42,2 km</name>
    <desc>Start on Rue de l'Exposition to the finish line at Place Jean-Béliveau. Near km 4 (Vanier) and at the Quai des Cageux loop (km 25) it follows the official 2026 course map; the rest is the gpx.studio track.</desc>
